==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{pathology}} An obstruction or occlusion of an [[artery]] by an [[embolus]], that is by a [[blood clot]], air bubble or other matter that has been transported by the [[blood stream]].

====Derived terms====
* [[pulmonary embolism]]

